243	    /**
244	     * Handles {@link DuplicateOwnerIdentityException} raised when an owner is created whose whole
245	     * identity key (normalized telephone, email and household id) already belongs to another owner.
246	     * Returns a 409 Conflict whose body carries an {@code errors} array naming the
